/v1/","context":{"app_id":3912360,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3912360-1846651706696144","game_id":"steam-3912360","kind":"announcement","title":"Stone Rebellion Demo Is Live for Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Steam Next Fest started yesterday, and the Stone Rebellion demo is out there! First, thank you. Seeing people jump in and start rebuilding their villages has been a joy for us. If you haven't tried it yet, there's still time. The demo is free, and it only takes a few minutes to see whether it's for you. The world fell, but the golems endure. Now it's time to fight back. What you'll be doing Rebuilding from the ruins You start with a single Town Hall and a lot of rubble. Lay roads, claim stone an","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T17:24:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696144","verified_at":"2026-10-21T03:12:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3912360-1844751498223413","game_id":"steam-3912360","kind":"announcement","title":"The Stone Rebellion demo is out: survive ten nights","summary":"A handful of golems escaped the Machine with one stolen crystal and set it in a lost city nobody has counted yet. Build by day. When the dark comes, hold the Town Hall. Survive ten nights.What's in the demoA complete ten-night run in Hollow Vale, in three acts: the beasts of the barren ring (nights 1–4), the Machine's Overseers (nights 5–9), and the Reclaimer on night 10.A new map every run. Lay roads, raise houses and put your mines and farms where the stone, food and crystal actually are.12 bu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T05:37:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498223413","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3912360-1844115010500018","game_id":"steam-3912360","kind":"announcement","title":"Stone Rebellion Playtest #1 Has Closed, Thank You!","summary":"That's a wrap: the Stone Rebellion playtest is officially closed!This week meant a lot to me. Watching people actually settle into the game, raise their golems, survive the nights, and come back with thoughts, that's exactly what this stage was for. Whether you sent a two-line bug report or a full breakdown of what felt off, every piece of feedback is going straight into how I shape the next stretch of development.A few things already stood out from what you shared, and I'll be digging through t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-20T23:59:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010500018","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3912360-1844115010489161","game_id":"steam-3912360","kind":"announcement","title":"Stone Rebellion Playtest Is Live!","summary":"I'm really happy to share that the Stone Rebellion playtest is officially open, which means you can play it right now!This has been a solo project for a while now: building a survival city-builder where escaped stone golems carry a stolen Crystal of Life, raising a settlement by day and defending it in grid-based battles by night. Getting it into your hands for the first time is a big milestone, and I honestly can't wait to see how it lands.The playtest covers the current build, and it'll stay o","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-16T13:42:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010489161","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3912360":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:00:33Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T01:00:33Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3912360":"2026-10-26T01:00:33Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3912360":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:00:33Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:00:33Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5242580":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:00:33Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:00:33Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3912360","app_id":3912360,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:24Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"fa58b0ca007ae180b22c979f4dbd1cda2d28d96df56aa36b2e3225a37d9cdc73","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"은 생존 도시 건설과 오토배틀러가 만난 게임입니다. 낮에는 폐허가 된 골렘 도시를 재건하세요. 돌과 수정을 캐고, 병사와 장비를 벼려 내세요. 해가 지면 군대를 배치하고 싸움을 맡기세요. 새벽마다 다시 세우고, 해질녘마다 전선을 사수하세요.","publishers":[{"name":"Dum Spiro Studios","creator_clan_account_id":45433535}],"developers":[{"name":"Martcororo"}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_date_message":"출시 예정","coming_soon_display":"text_comingsoon"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Stone Rebellion Gameplay Tailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1792356421","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"3912360/1211351827/df88759309a89ce907eb1b13c8a984255ba5b639/1792355522/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"3912360/1211351827/df88759309a89ce907eb1b13c8a984255ba5b639/1792355522/microtrailer.mp4","type":"video/mp4"}],"adaptive_trailers":[{"cdn_path":"3912360/1211351827/df887593